      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>Foundation Dental Center is committed to ensuring that fdcbonita.com is accessible to people with disabilities. We aim to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">Technical Measures</h2>
      <p>We have taken the following steps to improve accessibility on this site:</p>
      <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;margin-top:0.5rem;padding-left:1.25rem;list-style:disc;">
        <li>Semantic HTML structure with ARIA landmarks</li>
        <li>Sufficient color contrast for all text elements</li>
        <li>Keyboard navigation support throughout</li>
        <li>Visible focus indicators on all interactive elements</li>
        <li>Meaningful alt text on all images</li>
        <li>Skip navigation link for keyboard users</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">Known Limitations</h2>
      <p>We are actively working to improve accessibility across all pages. Third-party embedded content (such as maps or scheduling tools) may not fully conform to WCAG 2.1 AA.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">Feedback and Contact</h2>
      <p>If you encounter a barrier on this site or need information in an alternative format, please contact us:</p>
      <address style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
        {{ site.name }}<br />
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phone }}</a><br />
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
      </address>
      <p style="margin-top:var(--space-sm);">We will respond within two business days and work to provide the information you need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
